          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "7. The following table contains information about the number of dengue cases reported in a hospital over a period of one year:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.118,
            0.145,
            0.879,
            0.379
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "table_body",
              "index": 1,
              "bbox": [
                0.118,
                0.145,
                0.879,
                0.379
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_16_table_1.jpg",
              "content": "<table><tbody><tr><td>S. No.</td><td colspan=\"2\">1</td><td colspan=\"2\">2</td><td>3</td><td colspan=\"2\">4</td><td>5</td><td>6</td></tr><tr><td>Month</td><td colspan=\"2\">January</td><td colspan=\"2\">February</td><td>March</td><td colspan=\"2\">April</td><td>May</td><td>June</td></tr><tr><td>No. of dengue cases</td><td colspan=\"2\">10</td><td colspan=\"2\">12</td><td>15</td><td colspan=\"2\">18</td><td>22</td><td>40</td></tr><tr><td>S. No.</td><td>7</td><td colspan=\"2\">8</td><td colspan=\"2\">9</td><td>10</td><td colspan=\"2\">11</td><td>12</td></tr><tr><td>Month</td><td>July</td><td colspan=\"2\">August</td><td colspan=\"2\">September</td><td>October</td><td colspan=\"2\">November</td><td>December</td></tr><tr><td>No. of dengue cases</td><td>65</td><td colspan=\"2\">65</td><td colspan=\"2\">65</td><td>30</td><td colspan=\"2\">30</td><td>20</td></tr></tbody></table>"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.295,
            0.388,
            0.882,
            0.445
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Make a bar graph of the number of cases on the Y-axis and the month on the X-axis. Critically analyse your findings and answer the following:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.299,
            0.446,
            0.871,
            0.466
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(i) In which three months were the dengue cases highest?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.294,
            0.467,
            0.746,
            0.486
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(ii) In which month(s) were the cases lowest?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.289,
            0.487,
            0.883,
            0.526
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(iii) What natural or environmental factors during the peak months might contribute to the increase in dengue cases?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.29,
            0.527,
            0.883,
            0.583
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(iv) Suggest a few preventive steps that the community or government can take before the peak season to reduce the spread of dengue."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.267,
            0.584,
            0.883,
            0.641
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "8. Imagine you are in charge of a school health campaign. What key messages would you use to reduce communicable and non-communicable diseases?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.266,
            0.642,
            0.883,
            0.699
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "9. It is recommended that we should not take an antibiotic for a viral infection like a cold, a cough, or flu. Can you provide the possible reason for this recommendation?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.256,
            0.7,
            0.884,
            0.756
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "10. Which disease(s) among the following may spread if drinking water gets contaminated by the excreta from an infected person?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.293,
            0.757,
            0.882,
            0.779
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Hepatitis A, Tuberculosis, Poliomyelitis, Cholera, Chickenpox."
            }
          ]
        },
